#~ "asking any question, please refer yourself to the <a href=\"http://"
#~ "www.videolan.org/support/faq.html\">FAQ</a>.</p><p>You might then get "
#~ "(and give) help on the <a href=\"http://forum.videolan.org\">Forums</a>, "
#~ "the <a href=\"http://www.videolan.org/vlc/lists.html\">mailing-lists</a> "
#~ "or our IRC channel (<em>#videolan</em> on irc.freenode.net).</"
